格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Dynamic LLM Model Catalog Synchronization & Automated Balance Monitoring for DeepSeek Harness","id":"gh:1344047540","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-model-sync","slug":"GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-model-sync","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Dynamic LLM Model Catalog Synchronization & Automated Balance Monitoring for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# 📦 @goodandready/dsh-model-sync"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Dynamic LLM Model Catalog Synchronization & Automated Balance Monitoring for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"🇬🇧 English •\n🇷🇺 Русский •\n🇨🇳 中文说明"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"⭐ If you like this plugin, please star it on GitHub — it shows me that the plugin is useful to you a"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"nd motivates me to keep developing it."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"🐛 If you find a bug or would like to request a feature, open a GitHub issue in any language — I will"},{"id":"p6s2","text":" review your proposal and implement useful suggestions in a future plugin version."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## ⚡ Overview"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"**`dsh-model-sync`** keeps your **DeepSeek Harness** model catalog up-to-date with upstream AI provi"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"h-model-sync`** keeps your **DeepSeek Harness** model catalog up-to-date with upstream AI providers."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Instead of manually editing YAML configs whenever a provider launches a new model, adjusts context w"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"indow limits, or changes pricing, `dsh-model-sync` automatically discovers new releases, updates cap"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"ability metadata (`vision`, `tools`, `reasoning`, `embeddings`), tracks account balances, manages mo"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"del selection visibility, and reconciles models on the fly without server restarts."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## ✨ Key Features"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"* 🏷️ **Smart Collections & Catalog Auto-Tagging**: Automatically categorizes models into standardize"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"d tags (`coding`, `reasoning`, `fast`, `vision`, `long-context`) during discovery, provides fast pil"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"l-button filtering in the Web UI, and introduces a one-click \"⭐ Curated Best\" selection preset for t"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"op flagship models.\n* ⚡ **Latency TTFT Radar & Sparklines**: Probes response latency and Time To Fir"},{"id":"p12s5","text":"st Token (TTFT) across models, renders ASCII sparklines (` ▂▃▂ `) and 4-tier speed badges (⚡ `< 300m"},{"id":"p12s6","text":"s`, 🟢 `< 1.2s`, 🟡 `1.5 - 3.0s`, 🔴 `> 3.0s`), and exposes `GET /dsh-model-sync/health/latency` for in"},{"id":"p12s7","text":"telligent downstream routing.\n* 💸 **Dynamic Live Pricing Sync & Prompt Caching**: Periodic backgroun"},{"id":"p12s8","text":"d updates of live model pricing from OpenRouter and LiteLLM snapshots with persistent disk fallback "},{"id":"p12s9","text":"cache, tracking prompt cache read/write costs (`cacheReadPerToken`, `cacheWritePerToken`), with `GET"},{"id":"p12s10","text":" /dsh-model-sync/pricing` and `POST /dsh-model-sync/pricing/sync` endpoints.\n* 💰 **Built-in Referenc"},{"id":"p12s11","text":"e Pricing Database**: Canonical token pricing database automatically enriches models for OpenAI, Ant"},{"id":"p12s12","text":"hropic, Groq, Mistral, xAI, and DeepSeek, enabling cost-limit filtering and `@cheap` auto-resolution"},{"id":"p12s13","text":" even when upstream APIs omit pricing metadata.\n* 🎯 **Dynamic Smart Virtual Aliases & Auto-Fallback*"},{"id":"p12s14","text":"*: Route requests to virtual aliases like `@fast`, `@cheap`, and `@best-code`, with automatic fallba"},{"id":"p12s15","text":"ck chains when circuit breakers open or health probes fail.\n* 📏 **Real Context Limits & Boundary Saf"},{"id":"p12s16","text":"ety (`contextWindow` / `maxOutputTokens`)**: precise separation of input and generation limits, prev"},{"id":"p12s17","text":"ention of 400 `max_tokens` errors via auto-clamping, and clear `In: 128k | Out: 8k` badges in Web UI"},{"id":"p12s18","text":".\n* 🧠 **Unified Reasoning & Thinking Configuration**: automatic format detection (`effort`, `budget_"},{"id":"p12s19","text":"tokens`, `boolean`) and parameter translation with suppression of incompatible options (such as `tem"},{"id":"p12s20","text":"perature` on o1/o3).\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## 🛠️ Supported Discovery Providers"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| Provider Identifier | Authentication Format | Capabilities Auto-Detection & Notes |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| `openai` | Bearer Token | `vision`, `tools`, `reasoning`, `embeddings` |\n| `anthropic` | `x-api-ke"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"y` header | `vision`, `tools`, `reasoning` |\n| `google` | Query parameter / Key | `vision`, `tools`,"},{"id":"p15s3","text":" `reasoning`, `embeddings` |\n| `deepseek` | Bearer Token | `tools`, `reasoning` |\n| `xai` | Bearer T"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"oken | `vision`, `tools`, `reasoning` |\n| `openrouter` | Bearer Token | Multi-vendor model catalog w"},{"id":"p15s5","text":"ith pricing & context limits |\n| `groq` | Bearer Token | `tools`, `reasoning`, `vision`, `supportsDe"},{"id":"p15s6","text":"veloperRole: false` |\n| `mistral` | Bearer Token | `tools`, `reasoning`, `vision` |\n| `commandcode` "},{"id":"p15s7","text":"| Bearer Token | `https://api.commandcode.ai/provider/v1/models` catalog with `visibleModels` select"},{"id":"p15s8","text":"ion syncing to `llm-commandcode` |\n| `clinebot` | Bearer Token | Active subscription plan discovery "},{"id":"p15s9","text":"(`/users/me/plan`), restricting sync strictly to plan-included models |\n| `fireworks` | Bearer Token"},{"id":"p15s10","text":" | Open-weights inference endpoints |\n| `huggingface` | Bearer Token | Serverless Inference API cata"},{"id":"p15s11","text":"log |\n| `together` | Bearer Token | Open-source model catalog |\n| `ollama` | Local HTTP (`none`) | L"},{"id":"p15s12","text":"ocal offline model discovery (`/api/tags`) |\n| `custom` | Configurable | Any custom OpenAI or Google"},{"id":"p15s13","text":" compatible gateway |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## 📦 Quick Installation"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"> [!IMPORTANT]\n> Restart DSH Web UI after installation (`systemctl --user restart dsh-web`) to activ"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"ate background catalog synchronization."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## ⚙️ Configuration (`settings.yaml`)"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| Parameter | Type | Default | Description |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"| `enabled` | `boolean` | `true` | Master switch for background synchronization |\n| `scheduleEnabled"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"` | `boolean` | `false` | Enable periodic background synchronization schedule |\n| `intervalMinutes` "},{"id":"p22s3","text":"| `number` | `60` | Polling frequency for catalog refreshes in minutes |\n| `autoApply` | `boolean` |"},{"id":"p22s4","text":" `false` | Automatically apply discovered models to active catalog |\n| `requestTimeoutMs`| `number` "},{"id":"p22s5","text":"| `15000` | HTTP request timeout for catalog fetching (ms) |\n| `retryAttempts` | `number` | `3` | Ma"},{"id":"p22s6","text":"ximum retry attempts for transient network failures |\n| `concurrency` | `number` | `4` | Maximum par"},{"id":"p22s7","text":"allel provider synchronization workers |\n| `providers` | `array` | `[]` | Per-provider configuration"},{"id":"p22s8","text":" list (`provider`, `enabled`, `autoApply`) |"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"### 🔍 Active Capability Probing & Verification\n- **Micro-Probes**: Accurately test actual model capa"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"bilities rather than relying on declared flags:\n- `JSON Schema`: Tests structured output generation "},{"id":"p23s3","text":"(`response_format: { type: \"json_schema\" }`).\n- `Tools / Functions`: Tests function call generation "},{"id":"p23s4","text":"and parameter handling.\n- `Vision`: Tests multimodal processing with lightweight image payloads.\n- `"},{"id":"p23s5","text":"Developer Role`: Validates `developer` role prompt acceptance for advanced reasoning models.\n- **UI "},{"id":"p23s6","text":"Actions**: One-click \"🔍 Verify Capabilities\" on any provider card, plus global \"🔍 Verify All Models\""},{"id":"p23s7","text":" and \"⚡ Verify New Only\" buttons in catalog toolbar.\n- **Verified Badges**: Highlights confirmed fea"},{"id":"p23s8","text":"tures with green indicators (`✔ Tools`, `✔ Vision`, `✔ JSON`, `✔ DevRole`) persisted across restarts"},{"id":"p23s9","text":"ures with green indicators (`✔ Tools`, `✔ Vision`, `✔ JSON`, `✔ DevRole`) persisted across restarts."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
